## Mental Health Disclaimer

This article is intended for educational purposes only and is not a substitute for individualized relationship counseling, mental health care, or other professional advice. Every relationship is different, and the most appropriate form of support depends on the circumstances.

If your relationship involves violence, threats, coercive control, or fear for your safety, prioritize safety and seek appropriate confidential support. Couples counseling is not suitable for every relationship situation.

